OL,3,GNEWSATommy Robinson guilty of harassing
OL,4,AMail journalists
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolitical activist Tommy Robinson has
OL,7,Fbeen convicted of harassing two Daily
OL,8,FMail journalists.
OL,10,FA jury at Southwark Crown Court found
OL,11,Fthe 43-year-old, real name Stephen
OL,12,FYaxley-Lennon, guilty of two counts of
OL,13,Fharassment causing fear of violence.
OL,15,FThe case concerned Robinson's response
OL,16,Fto Daily Mail and Mail Online articles
OL,17,Ffrom August 2024, showing him on
OL,18,Fholiday in Cyprus while riots took
OL,19,Fplace in England following the
OL,20,FSouthport murders.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
