OL,3,GNEWSATommy Robinson guilty of harassing
OL,4,AMail journalists
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe court had heard how Robinson, from
OL,7,FBedfordshire, used "bully-boy,
OL,8,Fintimidatory tactics" to frighten
OL,9,Freporters Andrew Young and Jacob
OL,10,FDirnhuber, forcing them to employ
OL,11,Fsecurity or leave home.
